## 4. Current evaluation status

Aescia is preparing for its initial clinical feasibility study in Australia, subject to institutional and ethics approvals.

- **Expected start:** 2026
- **Expected duration:** Approximately 6 months
- **Study type:** Clinical feasibility evaluation
- **Governance pathway:** Site-specific governance and ethics review, as required
- **Status:** Preparation and stakeholder engagement phase

The company is engaging clinicians and health-system stakeholders to refine pilot design and implementation protocols. Institutional and site details will be published when public disclosure is appropriate.

Further evaluation details will be shared once governance and approvals are complete.

