## 6. What we are not claiming

- Aescia has not yet been evaluated in a randomised controlled trial
- Aescia-specific outcome data on readmissions, length of stay, or mortality is not yet available
- Effectiveness claims based on adjacent literature should not be attributed to Aescia as a product
- This page does not constitute regulatory clearance or endorsement

Illustrative modelled impact estimates — where used in internal planning documents — are hypothesis-driven, based on published literature and population assumptions, and are explicitly not presented as achieved Aescia outcomes.

